{"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSToolBarTop"}],"externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents14OUDSToolBarTopV","title":"OUDSToolBarTop","modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSToolBarTop"}],"platforms":[{"name":"iOS","deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false},{"name":"visionOS","deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"1.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false}],"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"struct"},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSToolBarTop"},"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI12ViewModifierP"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The top toolbar (aka "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"navigation bar","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" on iOS and iPadOS 18 and lower) sits at the top of the screen and provides contextual information"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and controls related to the current view."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It typically displays the page title, and may include navigation actions such as “Back” or “Close” as well as supplementary actions."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It can contains leading and trailing actions."}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSToolBarTop\/init(title:hasLargeTitle:subtitle:leadingItems:trailingItems:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers"},{"title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSToolBarTop\/body(content:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Method